[I] LTTng 2.0 Userspace Tracer

[T] LTTng-UST is the LTTng user space tracing library that allows any C or
[T] C++ application to be instrumented for and traced by LTTng. It also
[T] includes a logging back-end for Java applications and dynamically
[T] loadable tracing helpers for any application.

[U] https://lttng.org

[A] Lttng-ust Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

